<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS - MAY 16-19.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS - MAY 16-19.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>16-19. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 16-19	 May 15-16</p>
<p> CZK	0.44041	    0.44007</p>
<p> DKK	2.10122	    2.10143</p>
<p> FIM	2.64827	    2.65336</p>
<p> HUF	0.07503	    0.07494</p>
<p> JPY	0.11738	    0.11731</p>
<p> LTL	3.39905	    3.37784</p>
<p> LVL     23.89733	   23.73364</p>
<p> RUR	0.00236	    0.00234</p>
<p> SEK	1.78655	    1.78697</p>
<p> UAH	7.32568	    7.2839</p>
<p> USD     13.5928	    13.508</p>
<p> XEU     15.61473	   15.59026</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
